Nice, brunch.

116
00:06:36,890 --> 00:06:37,230
Kind of.

117
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:43,110
So I made scrambled and soft-boiled eggs, some French toast, and buttermilk pancakes.

118
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:45,530
