204
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,690
So I can have breakfast for dinner.

205
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,080
Right.

206
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:10,430
That's usually in America, you go to a diner because they have breakfast at four o'clock in the morning or at seven o'clock at night.

207
00:11:11,230 --> 00:11:12,610
